  "describe": "Phone: AAPL and name, $192.45, +$4.80 (+2.56%) today, green chart above a dashed 187.65, tag 192.45 and marker at now, then Open 188.40, High 194.25, Low 188.40, Volume 38.4M. Landscape: hero and stats left, chart right. 4x2: hero left, chart right, no stats. 2x2: hero over the line, no axes. With falling: red, down arrow, tag in red.",
